  "id": "section-628",
  "title": "调查成灾一例",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-008.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>008)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　对“关于‘调查研究’的调查”的批示<br>\n<br>\n　　如果还是如同去长辛店铁道机车车辆制造厂做调查的那些人们实行官僚主义的老爷式的使人厌恶得透顶的那种调查方法，党委有权教育他们。死官僚不听话的，党委有权把他们赶走。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-007.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-009.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
